<div class="pt-24 md:pt-32">
  <div class="ls-shell max-w-[1000px] mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(2.1rem,5vw,3.2rem)] leading-[1.1] mb-8">Africa should not only adopt the AI future. It should design it.</h2>

    <p class="text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      Building from Malawi, focused on African organisations, with a SADC perspective. Practical African AI adoption, enterprise transformation and governance.
    </p>

    <div class="bg-[var(--ls-cream)] rounded-[16px] p-6 mb-8">
