        <div>Malawi</div>
        <div>SADC</div>
        <div>Africa</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] space-y-2">
      <li>Building from Malawi</li>
      <li>Focused on African organisations</li>
      <li>SADC perspective</li>
      <li>African AI practice</li>
      <li>Applied AI for African institutions</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-4 text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">
      Do not use exaggerated claims such as "Africa's leading..." unless independently substantiated. Use credible language such as building from Malawi, focused on African organisations, SADC perspective, African AI practice, applied AI for African institutions.
